{"seq":2,"slug":"crossborder-payment-withholding-tax","title":"跨境权利金支付与预提税汇兑处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/royalty-system-operations/crossborder-payment-withholding-tax","wordCount":2994,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨境权利金支付与预提税汇兑处理\">跨境权利金支付与预提税汇兑处理</h1><p>一笔从境内企业汇给境外权利人的特许权使用费，在 <a href=\"royalty-calculation-engine\">特许权使用费计算引擎</a> 里算出的只是<strong>应付毛额</strong>；真正出境的金额要再穿过三道口径。税务口径：境内付款方是法定扣缴义务人，须在付款时预提所得税。外汇口径：跨境服务贸易付汇受真实性审核与对外支付税务备案约束，银行放行前要看完税凭证。海关汇率口径：同一笔许可费若计入完税价格，换算汇率与跨境汇出所用汇率并非同一个值。本文处理税率怎么定、备案怎么做、汇率怎么取、账怎么记。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-毛额-预提税与净汇出额的三层结构\">核心概念：毛额、预提税与净汇出额的三层结构</h2><p>特许权使用费跨境支付的金额关系可以写成一个闭合式：设合同约定的应付毛额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（即上一章拆出的基数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 费率），适用预提所得税率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则扣缴税额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = B \\times r_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，境外权利人实际收到的净额为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = B \\times (1 - r_w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子把三个部门的责任切开了：商务谈的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，税务定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，财务和银行管 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 能否出境。争议几乎总出在两处——合同写&quot;税后净额&quot;还是&quot;税前毛额&quot;，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取国内法定税率还是协定优惠税率。</p>\n<p>如果合同约定境外权利人取得的是<strong>税后净额</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，则付款方还要把预提税&quot;反算进&quot;付款成本，实务上称为 <strong>gross-up</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>gross</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{gross}} = \\frac{N}{1 - r_w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gross</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>gross-up 条款把税率风险从卖方转移到买方：卖方只关心到手净额，买方却要为税率上升承担全部增量成本，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从 5% 升到 10%，买方成本的放大是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1-r_{w2}}{1-r_{w1}}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3063em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8612em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 量级、而非 5 个百分点。因此许可合同必须把付款性质、协定适用与 gross-up 责任写成明确条款。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[合同应付毛额 B] --&gt; B{合同是税前还是税后?}&#10;    B --&gt;|税前毛额| C[扣缴义务人按 r_w 计算 T = B x r_w]&#10;    B --&gt;|税后净额| D[反算 B = N / 1 - r_w]&#10;    D --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; E{能否适用税收协定优惠税率?}&#10;    E --&gt;|能 已办备案| F[按协定 r_w 扣缴]&#10;    E --&gt;|不能| G[按国内法定 r_w 扣缴]&#10;    F --&gt; H[申报并取得完税凭证]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[银行凭完税凭证与对外支付备案放行购汇汇出]&#10;    I --&gt; J[境外权利人收到净额 N]&#10;    J --&gt; K[若许可费计入境内完税价格 按海关汇率另行折算]\">flowchart TD\n    A[合同应付毛额 B] --&gt; B{合同是税前还是税后?}\n    B --&gt;|税前毛额| C[扣缴义务人按 r_w 计算 T = B x r_w]\n    B --&gt;|税后净额| D[反算 B = N / 1 - r_w]\n    D --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; E{能否适用税收协定优惠税率?}\n    E --&gt;|能 已办备案| F[按协定 r_w 扣缴]\n    E --&gt;|不能| G[按国内法定 r_w 扣缴]\n    F --&gt; H[申报并取得完税凭证]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[银行凭完税凭证与对外支付备案放行购汇汇出]\n    I --&gt; J[境外权利人收到净额 N]\n    J --&gt; K[若许可费计入境内完税价格 按海关汇率另行折算]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>关心的量</th>\n<th>责任方</th>\n<th>关键凭证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商务/合同</td>\n<td>毛额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、净额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、gross-up 责任</td>\n<td>商务与法务</td>\n<td>许可协议付款条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税务（预提所得税）</td>\n<td>税率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、扣缴时点</td>\n<td>境内付款方（扣缴义务人）</td>\n<td>扣缴申报表、完税凭证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税收协定与受益所有人</td>\n<td>协定税率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、优惠资格</td>\n<td>纳税人/扣缴义务人申报</td>\n<td>居民身份证明、信息报告表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外汇</td>\n<td>购汇与汇出可行性</td>\n<td>银行 + 付款方</td>\n<td>对外支付税务备案表、合同、发票</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"预提所得税-国内法定税率是起点而非终点\">预提所得税：国内法定税率是起点而非终点</h2><p>多数税收管辖区对支付给非居民的特许权使用费实行<strong>来源地预提</strong>：只要许可标的在境内使用、或付款由境内主体负担，境内就有征税权。中国《企业所得税法》第三条、第三十七条及其实施条例把非居民企业来源于中国境内的特许权使用费所得纳入征税范围，法定税率 20%，但按《企业所得税法实施条例》第九十一条等规定<strong>减按 10%</strong> 征收，由支付方在付款时<strong>源泉扣缴</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.chinatax.gov.cn\">国家税务总局：非居民企业所得税源泉扣缴</a>）。10% 因此成为中国跨境权利金预提税的默认起点。</p>\n<p>要区分<strong>名义法定税率</strong>（20%）与<strong>实际执行税率</strong>（减按 10%）。系统里若把 10% 写死，一旦交易性质被重新定性（不适用优惠、或涉及常设机构归属），重算就会失败。正确做法是把法定税率、减征规则、协定优惠、判定条件拆成可版本化字段。</p>\n<p>美国的对应机制是 Chapter 3 预提税：支付给非居民的特许权使用费一般按 <strong>30%</strong> 法定税率预提，可适用协定则更低（<a href=\"https://www.irs.gov\">IRS Publication 515 / 26 CFR §1.1441</a>）。其特点是<strong>举证在收款方</strong>：收款方须提交 W-8BEN 主张协定待遇，否则付款方按 30% 全额预提。这决定了两地的系统差异——美国方向需要&quot;账户文件 + TIN 校验&quot;前置流程，中国方向依赖付款前的备案与申报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"税收协定与受益所有人-优惠不会自动到手\">税收协定与受益所有人：优惠不会自动到手</h2><p>国内税率只是上限，真正决定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的是<strong>税收协定</strong>。OECD《关于对所得和财产征税的协定范本》第 12 条把特许权使用费的来源国征税权设上限，普遍落在 5%–10% 区间（<a href=\"https://www.oecd.org\">OECD Model Tax Convention, Art. 12</a>）。中国对外签署的一百多份避免双重征税协定中，特许权使用费协定税率常见为 10%，部分为 7%、6% 或 5%（<a href=\"https://www.chinatax.gov.cn\">国家税务总局：税收协定</a>）。协定不能自动适用，须由纳税人或扣缴义务人<strong>主动申报享受</strong>并报送《非居民纳税人享受协定待遇信息报告表》，对真实性与合法性负法律责任。</p>\n<p>协定优惠的核心闸门是<strong>受益所有人（beneficial owner）</strong>：若收款方只是导管公司而非实际享有该笔所得的实体，即便持有对方国居民身份证明，也不得享受优惠。国家税务总局 2018 年第 9 号公告把判定细化为&quot;实质经营活动&quot;测试（是否有实质经营、所得是否在缔约国一方被征税、是否对所得具有控制权），并列出<strong>不构成受益所有人</strong>的负面清单（如所得在 12 个月内转付给第三国居民等）（<a href=\"https://www.chinatax.gov.cn\">国家税务总局公告 2018 年第 9 号</a>）。许多品牌方通过爱尔兰、荷兰、新加坡等中间控股主体收取亚洲区许可费，这类结构必须逐案验证实质经营，否则税率会从 5% 跳回 10%。结算系统要把协定税率、适用条件、备案状态、证明文件有效期建成独立字段，而不是把&quot;5%&quot;直接写进费率表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>协定税率适用性</th>\n<th>系统需要记录什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直付对方国权利人，具实质经营</td>\n<td>可适用协定税率</td>\n<td>居民身份证明、受益所有人自证、备案表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通过中间控股主体收款，无实质经营</td>\n<td>不得适用，回到法定 10%/30%</td>\n<td>穿透后的实际受益人、转付链条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合同含 gross-up</td>\n<td>税率成为敞口</td>\n<td>gross-up 条款、税率变动触发规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术服务费与许可费混合</td>\n<td>须分拆计价，可能适用不同条约条款</td>\n<td>费用拆分依据、定价文档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"国际反避税约束-pillar-two-对集团有效税率的挤压\">国际反避税约束：Pillar Two 对集团有效税率的挤压</h2><p>协定优惠之上，2021 年 OECD/G20 税基侵蚀与利润转移（BEPS）包容性框架达成的<strong>双支柱</strong>方案重塑了跨境许可的税务环境。支柱二（Pillar Two）设定<strong>全球最低有效税率 15%</strong>，适用于合并收入达 7.5 亿欧元门槛的大型跨国集团：若某辖区有效税率低于 15%，母国或相关辖区可就差额征收<strong>补足税（top-up tax）</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.oecd.org\">OECD：Tax Challenges Arising from the Digitalisation of the Economy</a>）。</p>\n<p>对许可费支付的影响分两层：一是<strong>低税辖区收许可费不再划算</strong>——无形资产置于低税地、由高税地成员支付高额许可费的经典结构，节税空间被有效税率地板压缩；二是<strong>预提税与支柱二交互</strong>——外国预提税在计算有效税率时通常计入&quot;覆盖税款&quot;，支付方被扣缴的预提税反而可能提高收款方的有效税率、降低补足税压力。工程含义：税费测算要在一条链路里同时评估进口关税、进口环节增值税、预提所得税、协定优惠与补足税。</p>\n<h2 id=\"外汇与汇兑-跨境付汇的合规闸门\">外汇与汇兑：跨境付汇的合规闸门</h2><p>许可费出境不是普通付款，而是<strong>服务贸易对外支付</strong>，受国家外汇管理局真实性审核约束。5 万美元以上的付汇，付款方通常须先办理<strong>对外支付税务备案</strong>，银行审验备案表、合同、发票后才办理购汇汇出（<a href=\"https://www.safe.gov.cn\">国家外汇管理局：服务贸易外汇管理指引</a>）。备案与扣缴强关联：未完成扣缴申报并取得完税凭证，备案和付汇都会受阻。三道闸门——扣缴申报、税务备案、银行放行——必须串行，任何一环卡住都意味着到期付款逾期，触发合同的滞纳金条款。</p>\n<p>外汇风险来自另一层：从签约、计提到实际购汇汇出可能横跨数月，汇率持续波动。付款方承受的<strong>汇兑损益</strong>分两种：合同以美元计价而记账本位币为人民币时，计提与支付之间的汇率差计入财务费用；合同以人民币计价而需购汇支付美元时，购汇汇率决定实际成本。gross-up 会放大这个敞口——税额按某一时点汇率折算，实际支付按另一时点，差额没有天然的承担方。</p>\n<p>海关口径与外汇口径的汇率来源不同：进口货物完税价格按海关适用汇率折算，通常为<strong>报关单填发之日所属月份的第三个星期三</strong>所适用的汇率；外汇付汇使用银行购汇汇率。两者不等值，跨月差异可达百分之几——一笔 500 万美元的许可费，1% 的汇率差就是 5 万美元。因此汇率取值日是显式业务字段，而非默认的&quot;付款当天&quot;，与 <a href=\"../licensing-royalty-model/royalty-base-and-rate-model\">特许权使用费基数与费率模型</a> 强调的&quot;时间与货币坐标&quot;一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结算期对不上账的三类根因\">结算期对不上账的三类根因</h2><p>把上述口径放进季度结算，三方账本不一致的根因高度集中。一是<strong>税率口径不一致</strong>：业务按协定 5% 计提，但备案未办妥或受益所有人证明不全，实际按 10% 扣缴，差额需补提。二是<strong>汇率时点不一致</strong>：计提、扣缴、购汇、海关折算各用各的汇率。三是<strong>金额归属不一致</strong>：财务按期间全额计提，海关按 <a href=\"../customs-valuation-mechanism/royalty-condition-of-sale\">特许权使用费与「销售条件」判定</a> 分摊到具体进口批次。&quot;当期成本&quot;的定义本就不同。</p>\n<p>解法不是追求三方数字相同，而是让<strong>差异可解释、可复算、可追溯</strong>：<strong>字段化</strong>（税率、汇率、备案状态、证明有效期全部落库，带取值来源与时间戳）；<strong>回放能力</strong>（净汇出额能沿&quot;毛额 → 扣缴 → 备案 → 购汇&quot;回放到原始凭证，延续 <a href=\"royalty-calculation-engine\">特许权使用费计算引擎</a> 的中间结果落库）；<strong>差异台账</strong>（税率差、汇兑差、归属差分别建账，明确责任人与调整规则）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨境权利金支付是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（毛额）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（预提税率）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（净汇出额）三层结构；合同写&quot;税后净额&quot;时须做 gross-up 反算。</li>\n<li>预提所得税起点是<strong>国内执行税率</strong>（中国非居民特许权使用费减按 10%），协定优惠税率（常见 5%–10%）<strong>不自动适用</strong>，须主动申报并满足受益所有人条件。</li>\n<li><strong>受益所有人</strong>判定是协定优惠的核心闸门，2018 年第 9 号公告的&quot;实质经营活动&quot;测试与负面清单是实务依据。</li>\n<li>支柱二的 15% 全球最低有效税率改变了低税地持有无形资产的性价比，且跨境预提税计入覆盖税款、与补足税存在交互。</li>\n<li>付汇受<strong>对外支付税务备案 + 银行真实性审核</strong>约束，扣缴、备案、放行三道闸门必须串行打通。</li>\n<li>海关折算汇率与银行购汇汇率来源不同、时点不同，跨月差异可观测；汇率取值日必须是显式业务字段。</li>\n<li>三方账本对不上的根因是税率、汇率、归属三类口径差；解法是字段化、可回放、差异台账。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨境权利金支付与预提税汇兑处理","id":"跨境权利金支付与预提税汇兑处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：毛额、预提税与净汇出额的三层结构","id":"核心概念-毛额-预提税与净汇出额的三层结构"},{"level":2,"text":"预提所得税：国内法定税率是起点而非终点","id":"预提所得税-国内法定税率是起点而非终点"},{"level":2,"text":"税收协定与受益所有人：优惠不会自动到手","id":"税收协定与受益所有人-优惠不会自动到手"},{"level":2,"text":"国际反避税约束：Pillar Two 对集团有效税率的挤压","id":"国际反避税约束-pillar-two-对集团有效税率的挤压"},{"level":2,"text":"外汇与汇兑：跨境付汇的合规闸门","id":"外汇与汇兑-跨境付汇的合规闸门"},{"level":2,"text":"结算期对不上账的三类根因","id":"结算期对不上账的三类根因"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"特许权使用费计算引擎与结算对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/royalty-system-operations/royalty-calculation-engine"},"next":{"title":"许可出口申报与单证数据链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/royalty-system-operations/license-export-declaration-filing"}}